{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cd88ba95-0814-8fa2-8e97-7d0100091eb4",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:56:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin A. Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:55:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:55:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Bottom line first: there's a tree down across my driveway and I need to know who I call. The city, my landlord, or the electric company?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:55:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a tree across your driveway. Was that from the storm this weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:55:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. The wind took it down sometime Saturday night. I can't get my car out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:55:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:55:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "278 Gidley Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "278 Gidley. Is the tree on your property or out by the street? And is it touching any wires?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:56:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the yard, fallen across the driveway. No wires that I can see. It's not near the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:56:06-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. If it's on private property, it's generally the property owner's job, so that would be your landlord. If it's a city street tree or in the roadway, we'd take it. If any wires are down or tangled in it, that goes to the utility, and you'd stay well away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So landlord, unless it's a city tree. Can you tell which one it is from here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:56:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not from the phone, no. I can have someone from the tree crew look at it, though, if you want it on the list. Is the trunk by the curb or back in the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:56:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Back in the yard. Okay, then I'll call my landlord now. I have an interview this afternoon and I'm running through my answers, so I want this settled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:56:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Good luck with it. If it turns out to be city property, call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:56:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks."
    }
  ],
